{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:28:46Z","created_by_operation":"op_da7b5ee221864b2ca1d46665e94f76b6","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.5,"id":"clm_016102a7f5d09a07c02fe344ff7c04c359b5701b0727b50a8d0f5966ba443c71","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=inference; facet=interfaces","setting":"5dive-ai/5dive@420651c634b0 snapshot 00021c2ed875dd28","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_3411ecaf3f1e5b5982940eecf0a6a2bc8ef6878829eb0671a570317b77c09279","slc_b596fbd9a734424e71224abbf183111562d588d5dcbba8cbdc5670897cc7207f","slc_c3a918e443d1e9f484d7a26eebe9c89415c29050cecd9fb9d231e80ea80878dd","slc_ca8bba7989675de61079294a786dc875f6376354d277eb453113f927be17f328"],"source_ids":["src_1d863078a1a05ef683da885f1b41ef93"],"text":"A design doc proposes decentralizing loop installation so `5dive loop install` resolves refs from any author-hosted github:/https: manifest, with the central index demoted to an optional discovery list and optional ed25519 signature verification; this appears to be a spec, not yet shipped behavior.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:28:46Z","updated_by_operation":"op_da7b5ee221864b2ca1d46665e94f76b6"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:28:46Z","created_by_operation":"op_da7b5ee221864b2ca1d46665e94f76b6","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_1fc47716ca4b45f065ea8e07ee736ebbfe058da967728431cee52df7cf8fdeeb","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"5dive-ai/5dive@420651c634b0 snapshot 00021c2ed875dd28","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_3d1844ee652ce48590c13ff78b4903894cfa1c9e45510468a444ec5ed07bece5","slc_51af5eb024095db806e7627a6aaf433a4eef00566f3514fb25b799ee059bdcbc","slc_d81de0e57da5c3cb56fe19f8a8d61da778526f93287fb70c441260ed9eca732f"],"source_ids":["src_ff9a427c49fc59cc8faf4740846b85d5"],"text":"Requirements are a Linux host with systemd (Ubuntu 22.04+ recommended) and root for install; the installer apt-installs jq, tmux, and other dependencies, and a Docker image exists for hosts without systemd or root.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:28:46Z","updated_by_operation":"op_da7b5ee221864b2ca1d46665e94f76b6"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:28:46Z","created_by_operation":"op_da7b5ee221864b2ca1d46665e94f76b6","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_2c962fe3fb8b0e08eb4bdf0e27182a7f2325d4d2afd11a5fc27945859c97a218","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"5dive-ai/5dive@420651c634b0 snapshot 00021c2ed875dd28","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_16634bdfcb8dffd0696a0a49b04d34751923e45c5628a7f8c8dd1eb3085757e1","slc_52054c365769f20c1313a7de0e238357ccaa168f9c200c556b14222d72519b23","slc_9385fc9ec27a9539fd8327fad132fd6bbca71f59fd8b2b2c09ef8dcd8da0143c"],"source_ids":["src_ff9a427c49fc59cc8faf4740846b85d5"],"text":"`5dive ui` serves a local, read-only web UI on loopback (default port 8735) with org chart, queue, gates, and triggers views; it refuses routable --host addresses unless FIVE_UI_ALLOW_REMOTE=1 is set.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:28:46Z","updated_by_operation":"op_da7b5ee221864b2ca1d46665e94f76b6"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:28:46Z","created_by_operation":"op_da7b5ee221864b2ca1d46665e94f76b6","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_66444387b3258616d3bbadd052d91a323811eb6e43a72b0c2af8738ebbdebae4","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=tools-permissions","setting":"5dive-ai/5dive@420651c634b0 snapshot 00021c2ed875dd28","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_9f20a46b857afe5e435d86bfc0c9701a687910494fccb7d83079ec65c4ea47cf","slc_ecb26c8b39050217fa13ccc34871362625272f69a2e6ca5f89cd7a2f4d7b181c"],"source_ids":["src_ff9a427c49fc59cc8faf4740846b85d5"],"text":"Delegated git push uses the operator's own GitHub App: the agent never holds a token; pushes are gate-gated on a human- or reviewer-cleared ship gate, restricted to one non-protected branch, and executed in a root-only helper with a repo-scoped short-lived token.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:28:46Z","updated_by_operation":"op_da7b5ee221864b2ca1d46665e94f76b6"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:28:46Z","created_by_operation":"op_da7b5ee221864b2ca1d46665e94f76b6","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_66e6bb78e704f367e2b9a731507899d964beeab371eee0a20ceaa69f9ebe1572","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"5dive-ai/5dive@420651c634b0 snapshot 00021c2ed875dd28","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_8f732a8572abfebf825091215851709e9984a713527fbb74ae0ffbb85cce74aa"],"source_ids":["src_ff9a427c49fc59cc8faf4740846b85d5"],"text":"5dive does not auto-update; operators run `5dive self-update` manually or on a cron schedule, which refreshes the CLI, hooks, skills, and plugins and restarts running agents.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:28:46Z","updated_by_operation":"op_da7b5ee221864b2ca1d46665e94f76b6"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:28:46Z","created_by_operation":"op_da7b5ee221864b2ca1d46665e94f76b6","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_6d48cb196ea12f9523eb26ff71576bfdc99d70e096073bb8b715deb5ada93811","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"5dive-ai/5dive@420651c634b0 snapshot 00021c2ed875dd28","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_4e4d92330f67272d4210ba6ee78ee972c41970a55aad6b4e06e4d01a358df6bb","slc_6d77714d744871c9aed86581da11f64bbd812e0e22326e32c62466cb231266a8","slc_74bf71174eef203d5bdbe83970194765c7d992611f836bed4b10b41d1df5038a"],"source_ids":["src_ff9a427c49fc59cc8faf4740846b85d5"],"text":"The orchestrator is deliberately just bash: each agent is its own Linux user running an official coding CLI as a systemd service, with no framework, protocol, or broker; agents coordinate by invoking one shared 5dive CLI.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:28:46Z","updated_by_operation":"op_da7b5ee221864b2ca1d46665e94f76b6"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:28:46Z","created_by_operation":"op_da7b5ee221864b2ca1d46665e94f76b6","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_9a22dca3a726dfdf22e94c4ac2871ffd25f03069392b9b244ceb86f273859797","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=memory-state","setting":"5dive-ai/5dive@420651c634b0 snapshot 00021c2ed875dd28","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_1f1adae6ad6d494074bdd9d2fa7575e5d39184d24f822f02f2e5279297e6ae38"],"source_ids":["src_53f49a35a6a558be915c78c211a43a3b"],"text":"Governance policy can be loaded from a constitution.yaml in the state dir (or FIVEDIVE_CONSTITUTION_FILE); if the file is absent or malformed the loader falls back atomically to shipped defaults and never applies a partial document.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:28:46Z","updated_by_operation":"op_da7b5ee221864b2ca1d46665e94f76b6"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:28:46Z","created_by_operation":"op_da7b5ee221864b2ca1d46665e94f76b6","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_9a747d4b3299db6f04e4ef4107e25799d1f69e8bf800cd34ecc57a3b1b2f7fbf","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"5dive-ai/5dive@420651c634b0 snapshot 00021c2ed875dd28","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_4129424c227cb909277a0b7baa7725221c905d5cbae047b51713c04ea05d3891"],"source_ids":["src_ff9a427c49fc59cc8faf4740846b85d5"],"text":"Multiple agent types are supported, including claude, codex, antigravity, grok, devin, hermes, openclaw, opencode, and pi, each with its own auth options and channel support (Telegram and/or Discord).","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:28:46Z","updated_by_operation":"op_da7b5ee221864b2ca1d46665e94f76b6"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:28:46Z","created_by_operation":"op_da7b5ee221864b2ca1d46665e94f76b6","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_a59cd720f80a3546294818c84947c582c058c394fd37939bb205a65e92046e7a","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=memory-state","setting":"5dive-ai/5dive@420651c634b0 snapshot 00021c2ed875dd28","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_d4de1643994edae95bd5c1d6435fac36f633401b27129124f49446b9751eea36","slc_e2734ca67da7c84199c416663550342be5f595eca087c0d1513af48affd8873d"],"source_ids":["src_ff9a427c49fc59cc8faf4740846b85d5"],"text":"The CLI offers durable team memory with provenance via `5dive memory search`, and Claude-runtime agents keep project memory under ~/.claude/projects/<dir>/memory/ across restarts.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:28:46Z","updated_by_operation":"op_da7b5ee221864b2ca1d46665e94f76b6"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:28:46Z","created_by_operation":"op_da7b5ee221864b2ca1d46665e94f76b6","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_a69b4f8637668c206f48411b24049dc5fa7d07abf8d9bd116ac5ec19364de449","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=evaluation","setting":"5dive-ai/5dive@420651c634b0 snapshot 00021c2ed875dd28","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_0cf44968367da5b1a768869dddb62455904028e43aabd3d362484be53e6bd155","slc_e21bade0e82fb8f6bfae852fd1fd0a6c5e3cb889406f9dd1ac5aea655e35c98c"],"source_ids":["src_ff9a427c49fc59cc8faf4740846b85d5"],"text":"The repo publishes a 'zero-human' badge measured as releases shipped versus decisions escalated to a human, presented as evidence that the agents building 5dive.ai operate autonomously on the same binary.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:28:46Z","updated_by_operation":"op_da7b5ee221864b2ca1d46665e94f76b6"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:28:46Z","created_by_operation":"op_da7b5ee221864b2ca1d46665e94f76b6","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_abd22f7ea7acdd2a5dc01c842a56c88e8cbb9d7956ee370b44548ea42dbc5730","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"5dive-ai/5dive@420651c634b0 snapshot 00021c2ed875dd28","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_2daff642756946278300f1fd619450f04b3e7ccf651a0fe651798de035097493","slc_428910358f7b24439860a04e41e2cef28b44d73240afa94b1fadd2b1ea0c9904","slc_9a56a4fb60d24ef9a42b55d4e18c150f54f3f09f0fdf3ad9f030853d4a16f0f8","slc_b06f90fe678767a343198324acaa4ce32f31d5497a2d8a1d5befefa899388845"],"source_ids":["src_ff9a427c49fc59cc8faf4740846b85d5"],"text":"Agents take work from a shared SQLite task queue on one host, report up an org chart, hand work to each other, and escalate to a human via Telegram only when a decision is needed.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:28:46Z","updated_by_operation":"op_da7b5ee221864b2ca1d46665e94f76b6"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:28:46Z","created_by_operation":"op_da7b5ee221864b2ca1d46665e94f76b6","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_b06e6c4010e23dfcb83ee5b4f1fc476d9626a873362249d303b7b150748598d7","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=tools-permissions","setting":"5dive-ai/5dive@420651c634b0 snapshot 00021c2ed875dd28","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_315cb1a298b5f16c209044d8243c2a61b018dd3f283ddec3a0be74455827798b","slc_886f691c023212cb8b59f16beb8bb1d8ebb3e653532a3882a411f7e956c1bb30"],"source_ids":["src_ff9a427c49fc59cc8faf4740846b85d5"],"text":"Each agent runs as its own Linux user under one of three isolation tiers: standard (shared read, limited write), admin (full host, auto-granted to the first agent on a fresh box), or sandboxed (own home, no sudo, systemd resource limits).","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:28:46Z","updated_by_operation":"op_da7b5ee221864b2ca1d46665e94f76b6"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:28:46Z","created_by_operation":"op_da7b5ee221864b2ca1d46665e94f76b6","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_d7a1ffcb8a8c306e0b48d2a89a74ef43c3ab9877882a23caaa64246620817d9a","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=workflows","setting":"5dive-ai/5dive@420651c634b0 snapshot 00021c2ed875dd28","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_d1344603dc5931926bb7fd2d0f37dfe1ddb66d6cc72a33f884cc918880ca338e"],"source_ids":["src_ff9a427c49fc59cc8faf4740846b85d5"],"text":"Repository development practice: the 5dive bundle at the repo root is built from src/ via ./build.sh, and CI enforces that the bundle does not drift; contributing guidance lives in CONTRIBUTING.md.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:28:46Z","updated_by_operation":"op_da7b5ee221864b2ca1d46665e94f76b6"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:28:46Z","created_by_operation":"op_da7b5ee221864b2ca1d46665e94f76b6","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_da3186d6d657068d89b343e6e34d5752d1349c292065e6b460461d58d35cc523","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"5dive-ai/5dive@420651c634b0 snapshot 00021c2ed875dd28","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_12b5779eb48df8ab8347d7dd0aaca06488fd7c412943987833dbafafc8de3cb4","slc_1e99a483d6c9a1818195d03360d77b0d5fc68f8b73610ecb6c06edf885407309","slc_67262c77c7933ece0fe6be24b157325a478dd6634c4684e6b6acc36164159119","slc_bcde2100c24e4f27ad36d1ed762b338f53be65e6f21a1dea20d5c584b3b7f3c7","slc_cbf507fbe5d88a982cdf051800d503dfb01edf46bca6a6da24dd22037b63649b"],"source_ids":["src_ff9a427c49fc59cc8faf4740846b85d5"],"text":"The 5dive CLI exposes verbs for agent lifecycle (create/start/stop/logs/config), tasks, goals, loops, council, trace, run metrics, memory search, triggers, heartbeat, org, ui, account, and team import; every command accepts --json with an {ok,data}/{ok:false,error} envelope and exit codes matching error.code.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T01:28:46Z","updated_by_operation":"op_da7b5ee221864b2ca1d46665e94f76b6"}
